Cell["\<\
A substrate is the graph a construction runs on. Every figure in this \
documentation is drawn on one, so an example starts with one line and no \
setup code.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"acae61d3-298c-4a65-9e2a-c4819e92b302"],

Cell["The roster has five classes:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"6b70bc42-4b4b-4583-afab-ff487c0c8e3e"],

